{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50742","headline":"寿州裴中丞出柘枝 · 张祜","name":"寿州裴中丞出柘枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青娥十五柘枝人，玉鳯双翘翠帽新。\n罗带却翻柔紫袖，锦靴前踏没红茵。\n深情记处常低眼，急拍来时旋折身。\n愁见曲终如梦觉，又迷烟水汉江滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}